content.text:
Now ui-core.js — the big UI rework:
1. Bitmap font already in pixel.js.
2. Canvas dialogue box with portrait, bitmap text, choices.
3. Canvas HUD (party, zone name, clock).
4. Canvas interact prompt.

And `say`/`choice` need to work in world mode via canvas. Let me design the Dialogue class:

```js
export const dlg = {
  open: false,
  speaker: '',
  text: '',
  choices: [],      // {text, value, note, req}
  idx: 0,
  typing: true,
  fullText: '',
  pos: 0,
  resolveSay: null,
  resolveChoice: null,
  visibleLines: ...
};
```

